# ValierShop.shop
# =============================
# Valier Sovereign-Style Shop (Wallet currency)
# Reads: Config/ValierShop.shop
# =============================
#
# Format:
#   category|Category Name
#   item|DisplayName|TypeName|Amount|Price|Hue|Description
#
# Notes:
# - Price is in Valier wallet coins (account-bound).
# - TypeName can be short or fully qualified.
# - Amount:
#     * stackables: sets Amount on the created stack
#     * non-stackables: creates N copies
# - Hue: 0 means default

category|Crafting Packs
item|Basic Blacksmith Pack|BasicSmithPack|1|5|0|200 iron ingots + tools
item|Basic Tailor Pack|BasicTailorPack|1|4|0|200 cloth + basic tailoring tools

category|Adventure Packs
item|Basic Adventurer Pack|BasicAdventurerPack|1|5|0|Bandages, scrolls, and potions
item|Basic Mage Reagent Pack|BasicMageReagentPack|1|6|0|50 of each basic reagent

category|Boosters
# Loot boost pricing tuned to your earning rate (~2/day login + ~1/hour played)
item|Loot Booster (30m)|LootBoostToken30m|1|5|0|+50% corpse gold (and small bonus loot roll) for 30 minutes
item|Loot Booster (60m)|LootBoostToken60m|1|9|0|+50% corpse gold (and small bonus loot roll) for 60 minutes

# Next boosters (ready when you want them in the shop)
item|Fame Booster (30m)|FameBoostToken30m|1|5|0|+50% fame for 30 minutes
item|Fame Booster (60m)|FameBoostToken60m|1|9|0|+50% fame for 60 minutes

item|Skill Gain Booster (30m)|SkillGainBoostToken30m|1|8|0|Skill gain multiplier for 30 minutes
item|Skill Gain Booster (60m)|SkillGainBoostToken60m|1|14|0|Skill gain multiplier for 60 minutes
